<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported</p>
<p>the following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of</p>
<p>Greek mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share</p>
<p>prices.</p>
<p>				   Apr 21/Apr 18    Apr 21/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.10		 4.92</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.08		 3.77</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.11		 6.13</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			    0.52		37.79</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.96		27.05</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  1.01		28.00</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.11		 4.85</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.00		12.87</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			    1.06		31.59</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  1.09		31.40</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.22		 8.26</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.54		51.99</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual</p>
<p>funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31,</p>
<p>1991.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
